                      <th>24 Aug 2022 (Wed), 8:00PM - 9:30PM</th>
                    </tr>
                </table>
                <br>
                <p><strong>*</strong><i>Confirmed details of orientation activity will be informed by Peer Mentors in your clan via email. </i></p>
                <br>
                <p>The nine clans that belong to SENG are: <strong><span style="color:#000000;">Inno</span>, <span
                            style="color:#46D349;">Eden</span>, <span style="color:#46C2FF;">Galaxy</span>, <span
                            style="color:#C74648;">Arcady</span>, <span style="color:#F1C733;">Eureka</span>, <span
                            style="color:#747474;">Nova</span>, <span style="color:#1C369A;">Xeno</span>, <span
                            style="color:#8F70AA;">Maestro</span>,</strong> and <strong><span
                            style="color:#1F6A31;">Endorphin</span></strong>. Click the clan logo below to check for
                    more details.</p>
                <br>
