                        <div id="step-6-cover" style="text-align:center;">

                            <div class="step-6-detail-text hidden" id="step-6-detail-0">
                                <p style="font-size: 48px; color:#000000; text-align:left;">Inno</p>
                                <p style=" font-size: 18px;text-align:left;">Theme: Community Engagement</p><br />
                                <p style="text-align: left">We were all once new students in HKUST, so we all understand the feelings of confusion and excitement and anxiety that comes with stepping into university life. 
                                    We are Clan 1 INNO, and we are committed to giving our peer mentees the guidance, resources and support they need to have a meaningful and fruitful experience at HKUST. 
                                    To do so, our clan focuses on COMMUNITY ENGAGEMENT. </p>
                                <p style="text-align: left">COMMUNITY – A united social unit. We aim to organize a variety of engaging and interesting activities, with the goal of building connections with our mentees, 
                                    between our mentees, and with our community as a whole. We hope that our mentees can build long-lasting friendships through our activities, 
                                    as we understand how important these connections are throughout university life. </p>
                                <p style="text-align: left">ENGAGEMENT – Interactions between community members. Through our activities, we aim to give our mentees the opportunity to not only engage with students from all backgrounds, 
                                    but to also engage their passion and interest in university life. With mentors studying in a variety of majors, from CIVL to IEDA to COMP to AI Extended Majors and more, 
                                    we have ample experiences to share with you!</p>


                                <br />
                                <p style="font-size: 20px; text-align: left"> Peer Mentors</p>
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-xs-3 col-sm-3">
                                        <img src="img/clan/inno/Adel.jpg" class="img-circle" width="100%" />
                                        <p>Adel (CSE)</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-xs-3 col-sm-3">
                                        <img src="img/clan/inno/Charlotte.jpg" class="img-circle" width="100%" />
                                        <p>Charlotte (MAE (AE))</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-xs-3 col-sm-3">
