                                        <img src="img/clan/inno/SzeSze.jpg" class="img-circle" width="100%" />
                                        <p>Sze Sze (CIVL)</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-xs-3 col-sm-3">
                                        <img src="img/clan/inno/Vedika.jpg" class="img-circle" width="100%" />
                                        <p>Vedika (CSE)</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>  
                            </div>


                            <div class="step-6-detail-text hidden" id="step-6-detail-1">
                                <p style="font-size: 48px; color:#E4ED7D; text-align:left;">Eden</p>
                                <p style=" font-size: 18px;text-align:left;">Theme: Music & Art</p><br />
                                <p style="text-align: left">Hi there! We are Eden. Named after the paradise garden where Adam and Eve lived according to Genesis, 
                                    we will show you the pristine beauty of our world through Music and Arts. We are dedicated to helping you to transition into life at HKUST, 
                                    expand your interpersonal network, adapt to, and advice for your university studies according to what we have already experienced 
                                    (including course selection, major selection, etc). Eden is where you can make new friends with similar interests and have an awesome kickstart of your 
                                    university life! Through various activities that we will organise throughout the academic year, not only can you enjoy socialising with your peers, 
                                    but you can also enjoy the beauty of our world through Music and Arts! Together we empower. 
                                    Join us and have fun! We very much look forward to seeing you in our clan! </p>
                                <br />

                                <p style="font-size: 20px; text-align: left"> Peer Mentors</p>
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-xs-3 col-sm-3">
                                        <img src="img/clan/eden/Albert.jpg" class="img-circle" width="100%" />
                                        <p>Albert (CPEG)</p>
                                    </div>
