                                        <img src="img/clan/eden/Richard.jpg" class="img-circle" width="100%" />
                                        <p>Richard (CSE)</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-xs-3 col-sm-3">
                                        <img src="img/clan/eden/Samuel.jpg" class="img-circle" width="100%" />
                                        <p>Samuel (MAE (AE))</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-xs-3 col-sm-3">
                                        <img src="img/clan/eden/Simar.jpg" class="img-circle" width="100%" />
                                        <p>Simar (CSE-DDP)</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-xs-3 col-sm-3">
                                        <img src="img/clan/eden/Valerie.jpg" class="img-circle" width="100%" />
                                        <p>Valerie (BIEN+AI)</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>


                            <div class="step-6-detail-text hidden" id="step-6-detail-2">
                                <p style="font-size: 48px; color:#87D9E7; text-align:left;">Galaxy</p>
                                <p style=" font-size: 18px;text-align:left;">Theme: Sports</p><br />
                                <p style="text-align: left">Hello, we are clan GALAXY! Under the galaxy, we look after each other selflessly. 
                                    This is just like our objective of how we help our mentees to adapt and integrate into the university environment. 
                                    Under the galaxy, all of our cultures live together in harmony. We want our clan to integrate as one big family and interact together, 
                                    forming an atmosphere of appreciating different cultures. Under the Sports theme, we work together like a sports crew, aim for a goalie, 
                                    and win as a team. No matter how diverse our backgrounds are, we can still mingle and have fun together! Through participating in our activities, 
                                    you can have more confidence in interacting with different people. We will appreciate the similarities and differences between us. 
                                    Together, WE ARE ONE TEAM, WE ARE GALAXY.  </p>
                                <p style="text-align: left">Clan 3 Peer Mentors </p>

                                <br />

                                <p style="font-size: 20px; text-align: left"> Peer Mentors</p>
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-xs-3 col-sm-3">
                                        <img src="img/clan/galaxy/Amber.jpg" class="img-circle" width="100%" />
