                                        <p>Wilson (CSE)</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>



                            <div class="step-6-detail-text hidden" id="step-6-detail-3">
                                <p style="font-size: 48px; color:#FF1343; text-align:left;">Arcady</p>
                                <p style=" font-size: 18px;text-align:left;">Theme: Community Engagement</p><br />
                                <p style="text-align: left">Hello, Bienvenidos, こんにちは, 你好, नमस्ते freshmen, we are clan 4! </p>
                                <p style="text-align: left">Our clan name, Arcady, refers to an utopian paradise. This year, 
                                    the core values of our clan have been built around the theme of Community Engagement. </p>
                                <p style="text-align: left">(Guess what? When you enter any lift on campus, it is possible to hear conversations in 4 different languages! ) </p>
                                <p style="text-align: left">We understand that adapting to a new environment, learning style, 
                                    and building new social circles while maintaining positive academic development is not easy for freshmen. Which is why we peer mentors, 
                                    are here to assist you in achieving your goals while overcoming all these challenges! 
                                    We are a group of mentors from diverse cultural background and majors and we are looking forward to adventuring with you guys. </p>
                                <p style="text-align: left">Various clan activities and mini-programs have been planned throughout the year for you to enjoy and socialize with fellow freshmen. </p>
                                <p style="text-align: left">Let’s explore the beauty of Hong Kong, the beauty of different cultures and the beauty of friendship(mentorship too!) together in Clan 4!</p>


                                <br />
                                <p style="font-size: 20px; text-align: left"> Peer Mentors</p>
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-xs-3 col-sm-3">
                                        <img src="img/clan/arcady/April.jpg" class="img-circle" width="100%" />
                                        <p>April (MAE-DDP (PG))</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-xs-3 col-sm-3">
