                            <div class="step-6-detail-text hidden" id="step-6-detail-4">
                                <p style="font-size: 48px; color:#FF9A00; text-align:left;">Eureka</p>
                                <p style=" font-size: 18px;text-align:left;">Theme: Music & Art</p><br />
                                <p style="text-align: left">Hi there, we are Eureka! - a team of international engineering students who are here to make your transition into university smoother 
                                    with the SENG community. Our theme is Music & Art, and we have planned a broad spectrum of fun activities for you to do throughout the year. 
                                    During the events, we will share our insight and advice on your university studies based on our past experiences at HKUST. </p>
                                <p style="text-align: left">We are looking for clan members who are willing to share their creativity and interact with fellow students actively. 
                                    Join us and you will not regret! </p>

                                <br />
                                <p style="font-size: 20px; text-align: left"> Peer Mentors</p>
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-xs-3 col-sm-3">
                                        <img src="img/clan/eureka/Alex.jpg" class="img-circle" width="100%" />
