                            <div class="step-6-detail-text hidden" id="step-6-detail-5">

                                <p style="font-size: 48px; color:#C1C1C1; text-align:left;">Nova</p>
                                <p style=" font-size: 18px;text-align:left;">Theme: Sports</p><br />
                                <p style="text-align: left">Heya!! We are Clan 6 better known as Clan Nova. As much as we all dread it, 
                                    physical fitness should be incorporated in our everyday lives as the secret to a healthy mind is a healthy body. 
                                    Semester work can be quite hectic, but we want to make sure, through our clan activities, that you give time towards improving your health and fitness. 
                                    We understand fitness alone could seem like a task but, with the inclusion of fun games and enjoyable company, anything can be made easy😀, 
                                    and that's what we've planned for you so that you can have the most fruitful experience at HKUST!!! </p>
                                <p style="text-align: left">Nova means “new” and new is always exciting but not necessarily easy. 
                                    We understand that your first year in this new environment can be like a roller coaster with ups and downs but we are here to support you every step of the ride. 
                                    Clan 6 mentors are very approachable, and funny too😁, always available for providing you with any assistance or guidance you might need during your time here and beyond. 
                                    Moreover, we are also here to encourage you to push yourselves out of your comfort zones to have new experiences and hope to inspire you to explore your inner talent. </p>
                                <p style="text-align: left">This year, we look forward to planning our activities with a muscular dose of zing and zest and cannot wait to share this experience with you! Vamanos! </p>
                                <p style="text-align: left">Through thick and thin, </p>
                                <p style="text-align: left">Clan 6 Peer Mentors </p>

                                <br />

                                <p style="font-size: 20px; text-align: left"> Peer Mentors</p>
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-xs-3 col-sm-3">
                                        <img src="img/clan/nova/Aarov.JPG" class="img-circle" width="100%" />
                                        <p>Aarov (ECE)</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-xs-3 col-sm-3">
