                            <div class="step-6-detail-text hidden" id="step-6-detail-6">

                                <p style="font-size: 48px; color:#1C369A; text-align:left;">Xeno</p>
                                <p style=" font-size: 18px;text-align:left;">Theme: Community Engagement</p><br/>
                                <p style="text-align: left">Hi everyone, we are XENO! The theme of our clan is community engagement — serving the community! 
                                    University life would be fascinating with new knowledge, meeting friends, and joining different societies. 
                                    Why don't share your happiness with the community too? 
                                    We will have a wide range of activities for you to learn how to serve the community and show a helping hand to others. 
                                    We can't wait to see you joining our activities to meet new friends and share happiness and excitement with others! 
                                    It's always meaningful to serve the community. See you in our activities! </p>
                                <br />

                                <p style="font-size: 20px; text-align: left"> Peer Mentors</p>
