                            <div class="step-6-detail-text hidden" id="step-6-detail-7">

                                <p style="font-size: 48px; color:#975FB8; text-align:left;">Maestro</p>
                                <p style=" font-size: 18px;text-align:left;">Theme: Music & Art</p><br />
                                <p style="text-align: left">Hello from Maestros. You’re invited to join our team and meet the peer mentor elites, 
                                    not in directing music, but in directing the engineering study path for freshmen. 
                                    We are ready and passionate to help and guide you in adapting to the warm HKUST and SENG community, 
                                    preparing for your amazing journey throughout your university life! </p>
                                <p style="text-align: left">As a Maestro, you will experience fun and magical activities related to music and arts throughout the year, 
                                    such as movie night, gathering session with music, games day, and more. During those events, 
                                    we will share our insights and experiences to help you make the best decisions for your university studies in the HKUST.  </p>
                                <p style="text-align: left">We are looking for members, yes including you, who are willing to share their creativity and bond with us actively. 
                                    Share HEARTS by ARTS! </p>
                                <br />

                                <p style="font-size: 20px; text-align: left"> Peer Mentors</p>
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-xs-3 col-sm-3">
                                        <img src="img/clan/maestro/Anson.jpg" class="img-circle" width="100%" />
                                        <p>Anson (ISDN)</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-xs-3 col-sm-3">
                                        <img src="img/clan/maestro/Crystal.jpg" class="img-circle" width="100%" />
