                            <div class="step-6-detail-text hidden" id="step-6-detail-8">

                                <p style="font-size: 48px; color:#39723F; text-align:left;">Endorphin</p>
                                <p style=" font-size: 18px;text-align:left;">Theme: Sports</p><br />
                                <p style="text-align: left">Hello there, we are Clan 9, or better known as Endorphin!
                                    This year, sports is selected as
                                    our theme because it can effectively help to boost our Endorphin, which is the "feel
                                    good" chemical that helps us to
                                    cope with stress in our brains. Our objectives are to provide assistance for
                                    freshmen to prepare themselves and live
                                    a joyful and enriching life in their first year at the HKUST. We hope to guide our
                                    freshmen in relieving stress and
                                    have a "feel good" UST life!</p>
                                <p style="text-align: left">As for how we transfer the importance of sportsmanship to
                                    mentoring, we want to team you up
                                    onto these 3 challenges:</p>
                                <p style="text-align: left">1. Dare to explore everything you never experienced,</p>
                                <p style="text-align: left">2. Step out from your comfort zones,</p>
                                <p style="text-align: left">3. Think out of the box.</p>
                                <p style="text-align: left">We also understand that the path might sometimes be bumpy
                                    for you to adapt in the first
                                    year, so never hesitate to ask us for help! We are a group of caring mentors that
                                    will always be there for you!</p>
                                <p style="text-align: left">We would also have various sports activities during the
                                    year! Our mentors would like to
                                    experience the sports activities with all of you! </p>
                                <p style="text-align: left">Last but not least, our clan has a Triple 'E' vision. That
                                    is, to Explore, Enrich and Enjoy
                                    university life together with us, the Endorphin!!!</p>


                                <br />

